     A          R HULIST
     A                                  1  2'Help - Users'
     A                                      DSPATR(HI)
     A                                  3  3'Everyone enrolled in the office.'
     A                                  5  3'Type part of a name, ID or departm-
     A                                      ent in Find and press Enter to sear-
     A                                      ch.'
     A                                  6  3'Options: 2 changes a user, 5 disab-
     A                                      les or enables, 4 removes.'
     A                                  7  3'You can also put the cursor on a l-
     A                                      ine and press Enter to pick it.'
     A                                  9  3'A disabled user cannot open the of-
     A                                      fice.  You cannot disable yourself.'
     A                                 10  3'F6 enrolls a new user.'
     A                                 11  3'F7 and F8 page backward and forwar-
     A                                      d through a long list.'
     A                                 23  2'Press Enter to return.'
     A                                      COLOR(BLU)
     A          R HUEDIT
     A                                  1  2'Help - Enroll or change a user'
     A                                      DSPATR(HI)
     A                                  3  3'User ID is the OS/400 user profile-
     A                                       name.  It cannot be changed later.'
     A                                  4  3'Administrator: Y lets the user int-
     A                                      o the Administration menu.'
     A                                  6  3'For a new user, Create sign-on Y a-
     A                                      lso creates the OS/400 user profile-
     A                                       with'
